data: {"id": "babbac6907b941d0-thinking-parallel_evidence-884", "run_id": "babbac6907b941d0", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "基于已采集的工具结果，对 `aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-bwqhh` 的分析如下：\n\n### 1. 实体身份确认\n*   **Pod**: `workload-79d9f8fd88-bwqhh` (Namespace: `aiops-case-10`)\n*   **UID**: `f2db1889-e2c8-4073-b40b-7603dc0755f7`\n*   **节点**: `node2`\n\n### 2. 支持候选原因的证据 (OOMKill -> CrashLoopBackOff)\n以下事实强力支持 **\"容器因内存超限 (OOMKill/Exit 137) 崩溃，导致 CrashLoopBackOff\"** 这一根因：\n*   **退出状态与代码**: `kubectl describe` 和 `kubectl_get_yaml` 显示容器状态为 `CrashLoopBackOff`，**Exit Code 为 137**。在 Kubernetes 中，退出码 137 明确指示容器进程被内核 OOM Killer 信号 (SIGKILL)", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788818852302, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

